  "description": {
   "en": "Thoughtful young man (⍺) x introverted painter (Ω)\n\nLove remakes life!!\n\nRuka – creator of the famous character Mimigel – is an illustrator with an introverted personality. Because he was tired of being changed too much, not to his liking, he gave up the copyright to the character Mimigel and took a plane to move to a far away place to live. During his flight, the plane suddenly had a shaking problem. Before he knew it, he found himself in a world where strange words like \"second gender,\" \"omega,\" \"sex\" were everywhere.\n\nAnd what will his new life be like?!"
  },
